<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram id="k9UcGQXWE7TpJZ_gsLz6" name="DSA-Hashmap">
        <mxGraphModel dx="493" dy="528" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="4" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Time complexity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Think of your eligibility system. Today it processes 1,000 insurance cards a night. Next year the company onboards a client and it&#39;s 100,000. The question that matters is not &quot;how fast is it?&quot; — it&#39;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&quot;when input went up 100×, did work go up 100× or 10,000×?&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; That ratio is the whole subject.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Three growth classes you&#39;ll meet constantly:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-collapse: collapse;&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Growth&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Meaning&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Healthcare example&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;O(1)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Input grows, work doesn&#39;t&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Hash lookup of a patient by MRN&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;O(n)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Work grows in step with input&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Scanning a FHIR Bundle once&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;O(n²)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Work grows as the square&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Comparing every patient to every other patient&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Finding the duplicate MRN from a list of MRNs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Using a brute force method, with nested forloops &lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;→ outer-loop counting from 0 to len(mrn_list)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;→ inner-loop counting from i+1 to len(mrn_list)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;causes the time complexity to be O(n^2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Solution to this is using a set to know which all mrns have we come across and if we have come across an mrn, then add it to a duplicates array&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;454&quot; width=&quot;520&quot; src=&quot;data:image/jpeg;base64,&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Using a set to find duplicates →&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&quot;I trade O(n) extra space for a drop from O(n²) to O(n) time.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;====================================================&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The Day 2 question is on the table and still open. Restating it so you don&#39;t have to scroll:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Given that diagram of 8 slots where a key computes its own location —&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;If the hash function were badly written, so that it returned the same value for every MRN, what would the 8 slots look like, and what would lookup cost become in Big-O?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Sketch the slots, then give the complexity. And this time give me the &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; in a sentence — that&#39;s the part that&#39;s been going missing, and it&#39;s the part that makes this transfer to the next problem.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.05);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;O(n)  as we need to keep checking all the values of the mrn_list&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: color(srgb 1 1 1 / 0.05);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;slot:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;0&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 1&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 2&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 4&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 5&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 6&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 7&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ] [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ] [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ] [mrn1] [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ] [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ] [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ] [&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ↓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;[mrn2]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ↓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;[mrn3]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ↓&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;... mrn8&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;Seven slots sit empty. One slot holds a chain of length &lt;code&gt;n&lt;/code&gt;. So the hash map has quietly &lt;strong&gt;become a linked list&lt;/strong&gt;, and every &lt;code&gt;O(1)&lt;/code&gt; guarantee you were relying on collapses with it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: light-dark(rgb(63, 63, 63), rgb(183, 183, 183));&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;⭐The thing to car&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;ry forward&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong style=&quot;&quot;&gt;hash map lookup is O(1) on average, O(n) in the worst case.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐🟢Understood and solved 2sum → &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jamadagniVijay/coding-practice/blob/a4d94b008818178f2d0d90456803d67605e14538/python_code/loops.ipynb#L16&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 255);&quot;&gt;github jupyer noteBook&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-collapse: collapse;&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;thead style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot; scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Pattern&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot; scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Dict/Set holds&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot; scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Question it answers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Seen-set&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;key (or key → index)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&quot;Have I encountered this before?&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Frequency map&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;key → count&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&quot;How many times does each thing appear?&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;Grouping map&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;derived key → list of items&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&quot;Which items share a property?&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;The transferable skill isn&#39;t the dict — it&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;&quot;what key makes equivalent things identical?&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt; Anagrams → sort.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;Dirty fields → normalise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;Multi-field → tuple.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=15;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="26" width="750" height="1934" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="DLZ_1jqakzSehgY56j9m" name="Sliding_Window">
        <mxGraphModel dx="844" dy="364" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="w6rBX8RKvK-bx7d3rfvW-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;Sliding window&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Hashmap destroys order → while checking of a patient&#39;s MRN, we are noticing that there is no order / when the patient or member was last checked. But some asks adhere to adjecency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text